{"seq":39,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1079"},"reason":"The body called Akka and her flock greylag geese (and claimed this explains why the domestic gander keeps up). Lagerlöf's text distinguishes the wild geese from greylags (Dunfin is the greylag); the sentence now says the species is never named, that the flock is taken to be bean geese (the 1906 folk 'vildgås'), in EN/DE/RU; notes explain the accepted answer and the popular mistake.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://runeberg.org/nilsholg/k10.html"},{"url":"https://www.saob.se/artikel/?seek=vildgås"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",956],["-","Akka"],["+","Lagerlöf"],["=",1],["-","herself,"],["+","never"],["=",1],["-","like"],["+","names"],["=",1],["+","Akka's species, but she keeps her flock of wild geese apart from "],["=",2],["-","rest"],["+","greylag"],["=",1],["+","geese they meet on the coast – the greylag "],["=",2],["-","her"],["+","the"],["=",1],["-","flock,"],["+","story"],["=",3],["-","a"],["+","Dunfin,"],["=",1],["-","greylag"],["+","whom"],["=",1],["-","goose,"],["+","Martin"],["=",1],["-","Anser"],["+","later"],["=",1],["-","anser"],["+","marries"],["=",3],["+","and Akka and her flock are taken to be "],["=",2],["-","large"],["+","bean"],["=",1],["+","goose, Anser fabalis, the "],["=",6],["-","from"],["+","that"],["=",1],["-","which"],["+","breeds"],["=",1],["+","in "],["=",2],["-","domestic"],["+","Lapland"],["=",1],["-","goose"],["+","fells"],["=",1],["-","was"],["+","and"],["=",1],["-","bred,"],["+","that"],["=",1],["-","which"],["+","Swedish"],["=",1],["-","explains"],["+","folk"],["=",1],["-","why"],["+","speech"],["=",1],["-","Martin"],["+","of"],["=",1],["-","can"],["+","her"],["=",1],["-","keep"],["+","day"],["=",1],["-","up"],["+","simply"],["=",1],["-","with"],["+","called"],["=",1],["-","them"],["+","\"vildgås\","],["=",1],["-","at"],["+","the"],["=",1],["-","all."],["+","wild goose."],["=",174]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",912],["-","Akka"],["+","Lagerlöf"],["=",1],["-","ist"],["+","nennt"],["=",1],["-","wie"],["+","Akkas"],["=",1],["-","ihr"],["+","Art"],["=",1],["-","ganzer"],["+","nie,"],["=",1],["-","Schwarm"],["+","unterscheidet"],["=",1],["-","eine"],["+","ihren"],["=",1],["-","Graugans,"],["+","Wildgansschwarm"],["=",1],["-","Anser"],["+","aber"],["=",1],["-","anser"],["+","von"],["=",1],["+","den Graugänsen, denen er an der Küste begegnet "],["=",4],["-","große"],["+","Graugans"],["=",1],["+","der Geschichte ist Daunenfein, die Martin später heiratet –, und Akka und ihr Schwarm gelten als die Saatgans, Anser fabalis, die "],["=",4],["-","aus"],["+","die"],["=",1],["-","der"],["+","in"],["=",1],["-","die"],["+","den"],["=",1],["-","Hausgans"],["+","Fjällen"],["=",1],["-","gezüchtet"],["+","Lapplands"],["=",1],["-","wurde;"],["+","brütet"],["=",1],["-","das"],["+","und"],["=",1],["-","erklärt,"],["+","die"],["=",1],["-","warum"],["+","der"],["=",1],["-","Martin"],["+","schwedische"],["=",1],["-","überhaupt"],["+","Volksmund"],["=",1],["-","mit"],["+","ihrer"],["=",1],["-","ihnen"],["+","Zeit"],["=",1],["-","mithalten"],["+","schlicht"],["=",1],["-","kann."],["+","„vildgås“, Wildgans, nannte."],["=",160]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",842],["-","Сама"],["+","Лагерлёф"],["=",1],["-","Акка,"],["+","нигде"],["=",1],["-","как"],["+","не"],["=",1],["-","и"],["+","называет"],["=",1],["-","вся"],["+","вид"],["=",1],["+","Акки, но отличает "],["=",2],["-","стая,"],["+","стаю"],["=",1],["+","диких гусей от серых гусей, встреченных на побережье (серый гусь в этой истории "],["=",2],["-","серый"],["+","Дунфин,"],["=",1],["-","гусь,"],["+","на"],["=",1],["-","Anser"],["+","которой"],["=",1],["-","anser,"],["+","Мартин"],["=",1],["-","крупный"],["+","потом"],["=",1],["+","женится); вид Акки и её стаи — гуменник, Anser fabalis, "],["=",6],["-","от"],["+","который"],["=",1],["-","которого"],["+","гнездится"],["=",1],["-","выведен"],["+","в"],["=",1],["-","домашний"],["+","горах"],["=",1],["-","гусь,"],["+","Лапландии"],["=",1],["-","—"],["+","и"],["=",1],["-","вот"],["+","которого"],["=",1],["-","почему"],["+","шведская"],["=",1],["-","Мартин"],["+","народная"],["=",1],["-","вообще"],["+","речь"],["=",1],["-","может"],["+","её"],["=",1],["-","за"],["+","времени"],["=",1],["-","ними"],["+","называла"],["=",1],["-","поспевать."],["+","просто «vildgås», «дикий гусь»."],["=",164]]},{"field":"notesEn","diff":[["=",69],["+"," Akka's species: Lagerlöf never names it and sets the flock's \"vildgäss\" apart from \"grågäss\" (greylag geese); the greylag of the book is Dunfin. Swedish folk speech of 1906 used \"vildgås\" chiefly for the bean goose, which breeds in the Lapland fells, so \"bean goose\" (also \"taiga bean goose\") is the accepted answer; the often-heard \"greylag goose\" is a popular mistake."]]},{"field":"notesDe","diff":[["=",59],["+"," Akkas Art: Lagerlöf nennt sie nie und unterscheidet die „vildgäss“ des Schwarms von den „grågäss“ (Graugänsen); die Graugans des Buchs ist Daunenfein. Der schwedische Volksmund von 1906 meinte mit „vildgås“ vor allem die Saatgans, die in den Fjällen Lapplands brütet; daher gilt „Saatgans“ (auch „Waldsaatgans“) als Antwort, die oft gehörte „Graugans“ ist ein verbreiteter Irrtum."]]},{"field":"notesRu","diff":[["=",57],["+"," Вид Акки: Лагерлёф его не называет и отличает «vildgäss» стаи от «grågäss» (серых гусей); серый гусь в книге — Дунфин. Шведская народная речь 1906 года называла «vildgås» прежде всего гуменника, гнездящегося в горах Лапландии, поэтому ответ — «гуменник» (также «таёжный гуменник»); часто встречающийся «серый гусь» — распространённая ошибка."]]}],"hash":"943123ac4ee4","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"b854b2bc4d8568d23d8219bca4f1cdf0761bc7483e49cfbe8c4af1eff343fddb"},
{"seq":40,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f05395"},"reason":"Akka was given as a greylag goose. Lagerlöf never names her species and her text keeps the flock's 'vildgäss' apart from 'grågäss' (ch. X: the wild geese meet some greylags on a skerry; ch. XXXVI: Dunfin is 'den lilla grågåsen' among 'alla vildgässen'). In 1906 Swedish folk speech 'vildgås' meant chiefly the bean goose (SAOB, quoting Ericson 1906), and ornithologists identify the Lapland-breeding flock as (taiga) bean geese. Answer changed to bean goose / Saatgans / гуменник, source and entity updated, flagged contested.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://runeberg.org/nilsholg/k10.html"},{"url":"https://runeberg.org/nilsholg/k36a.html"},{"url":"https://www.saob.se/artikel/?seek=vildgås"},{"url":"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Die_wunderbare_Reise_des_kleinen_Nils_Holgersson_mit_den_Wildg%C3%A4nsen"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","old":"greylag goose","new":"bean goose"},{"field":"answerDe","old":"Graugans","new":"Saatgans"},{"field":"answerRu","old":"серый гусь","new":"гуменник"},{"field":"spans","old":{"en":[2921,13],"de":[3237,8],"ru":[2976,10]},"new":{"en":[3110,10],"de":[3438,8],"ru":[3146,8]}},{"field":"source","old":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Wonderful_Adventures_of_Nils","title":"The Wonderful Adventures of Nils – Wikipedia","lang":"en"},"new":{"url":"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Die_wunderbare_Reise_des_kleinen_Nils_Holgersson_mit_den_Wildg%C3%A4nsen","title":"Die wunderbare Reise des kleinen Nils Holgersson mit den Wildgänsen – Wikipedia","lang":"de"}},{"field":"tags","old":["difficulty:medium"],"new":["difficulty:medium","risk:contested"]},{"field":"entities","old":[{"qid":"Q25882","label":"Greylag Goose","role":"answer"}],"new":[{"qid":"Q26452","label":"Taiga Bean Goose","role":"answer"}]}],"hash":"bda234beffd1","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"fad3e66e4f94